# Build outputs must never enter the image: obj/project.assets.json generated
# on Windows records host-specific NuGet folders (e.g. C:\Program Files (x86)\...
# \NuGetPackages as a fallback folder), which breaks ResolvePackageAssets on Linux.
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/

# IDE / editor state
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Git metadata (not required at build time)
.git/
.gitignore

# Documentation
**/*.md

# Docker configuration itself is not needed inside the image
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/.dockerignore
